{"Multiple cancellation/reschedule paths call deleteScheduledEmailReminder/deleteScheduledSMSReminder without awaiting or collecting the returned promises, so the Prisma update/delete that prevents reminders from being sent may not complete before the request finishes, leaving workflow reminders active and still sent after a booking is cancelled/rescheduled": 0.9558179378509521, "deleteScheduledEmailReminder with immediateDelete=true returns after the SendGrid request without marking the WorkflowReminder as cancelled or deleting it, and errors are swallowed. If the SendGrid request fails, the reminder remains scheduled and is not eligible for the cron-based cancellation path, so it can still be sent": 0.8964589834213257}